POST /orgs/{org}/personal-access-token-requests/{pat_request_id}
Approves or denies a pending request to access organization resources via a fine-grained personal access token. Only GitHub Apps can use this endpoint.
Required: org (path) — The organization name. The name is not case sensitive.; pat_request_id (path) — Unique identifier of the request for access via fine-grained personal access token.; body (body)
